Package: EvidSynthTB
Type: Package
Title: Bayesian Multi-Parameter Evidence Synthesis for TB Epidemiology
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Nathan", "Green", , "n.green@ucl.ac.uk", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Bayesian Multi-Parameter Evidence Synthesis (MPES) linking latent
    tuberculosis infection (LTBI) diagnostic survey data with active TB
    progression survival data using mixture cure models, imperfect diagnostic
    test models, and modular/cut inference in Stan.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://n8thangreen.github.io/EvidSynthTB/, https://github.com/n8thangreen/EvidSynthTB
BugReports: https://github.com/n8thangreen/EvidSynthTB/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
